  "published": "2026-02-03T20:33:58.94Z",
  "releaseNotes": "- Bug fix: the WW.Cad.Drawing.Wireframe rendering pipeline should not include the font descent when calculating text bounds used to calculate the MTEXT background fill rectangle.\n- Bug fix: the WW.Cad.Drawing.Wireframe rendering pipeline did not handle a non-null GraphicsConfig.FixedForegroundColor correctly for MTEXT background rectangle with window color.\n- Bug fix: the PdfExporter did not stroke filled text shapes and filled MTEXT background shapes in the correct color when PlotOptions.StrokeNonTextPolygons was set.\n- Breaking change: removed parameter correctForBackgroundColor from interface WW.Cad.Model.IPathDrawer.\n- Updated PDF and SVG export example projects, V2 exporters are now included, but the classic exporters are used by default.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
